    ownership:[{title:"Your First Year as a Homeowner",read:"8 min",body:"Budget 1-3% of home value annually for maintenance. Build a home emergency fund of $5,000-$15,000. Understand your HOA if applicable. Learn your home systems — HVAC, plumbing, electrical. Set up automatic mortgage payments to protect your credit."},
    {title:"Building Equity Over Time",read:"5 min",body:"Equity grows through appreciation and mortgage paydown. On a $300,000 home with 3% annual appreciation, you gain $9,000 in value per year. Extra principal payments can save thousands in interest and years off your loan."}],
